# Keep the Docker build context lean, and free of anything that changes
# without a source change. Bytecode is the important one: the images COPY
# bot_bottle/, so a stray .pyc from a local run would change the image digest
# and make every launch recreate the gateway (an installed wheel's staged
# build root already drops it; see resources.py).
.git
.gitignore
.dockerignore
.claude
docs
*.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
